<title>NETHERLANDS: SLIGRO CONFIRMS 1996 NET, RAISES DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>SLIGRO CONFIRMS 1996 NET, RAISES DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     6.03 vs   5.32</p>
<p>    Net profit			    19.7  vs  16.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  2.30 vs   2.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			     952.8  vs 865.5</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    34.8  vs  30.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Groceries wholesaler Sligro Beheer NV said in January</p>
<p>it expected a preliminary 1996 net of 19.7 mln guilders.</p>
<p>The 1996 dividend can be taken up in cash or in new shares.</p>
<p>Details of the stock dividend will be published on March 17.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
